; Tabitha, sketch E "Stupid Weak People": G minor, 120 bpm. A sneering march: the trumpet speaks the hook in the rhythm of her words (short short LONG, short short LONG) over chopped cold strings, a bass on the beats, snare march and timpani. Same family as Caulder D, but hers. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song tabitha_e
tempo 120
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

